# AI-Suplex Ultra — local thin host. No secrets here; these are local paths only.

# Absolute path to the AI-Suplex-777 vault (read-only to this app).
# Defaults to ~/Projects/AI-Suplex-OS/Deep-Ultra-OS/AI-Suplex-777 when unset.
AISUPLEX_VAULT="/home/kmagwenzi/Projects/AI-Suplex-OS/Deep-Ultra-OS/AI-Suplex-777"

# Capability tier: "ultra" (default) | "free". A capability flag, never a license.
# Under "free" the six Ultra surfaces render a named gate, not a preview.
AISUPLEX_TIER="ultra"
